<style>
:root{color-scheme:light;--ink:#172a45;--muted:#72839a;--line:#e5eaf1;--blue:#2465ed}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);background:#f5f7fb;font-size:14px}button,a{font:inherit}button{cursor:pointer}button:focus-visible,a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #88b6ff;outline-offset:3px}.sidebar{width:220px;position:fixed;inset:0 auto 0 0;background:#fff;border-right:1px solid var(--line);padding:29px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.brand{font-size:23px;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:-.05em;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px}.brand-icon{font-size:24px;color:var(--blue)}.brand-sub{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:#8393aa;margin:8px 0 44px 35px}.nav-label{font-size:10px;color:#9aa7b9;letter-spacing:.14em;margin:0 12px 12px}.nav{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:11px 13px;color:#76869d;border-radius:9px;margin-bottom:8px}.nav.current{color:#2260dd;background:#edf3ff;font-weight:600}.nav i{font-style:normal;font-size:18px;width:18px}.sidebar-foot{margin-top:auto;padding:16px 12px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);color:#9aa7b9;font-size:11px}.dot{display:inline-block;background:#3bbd97;width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;margin-right:6px}main{margin-left:220px;max-width:1500px}.topbar{height:81px;background:#ffffffcc;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:0 40px}.breadcrumb{color:#7e8fa6;font-size:12px}.breadcrumb strong{color:#3b506c;font-weight:500}.badge{background:#fff4e7;border:1px solid #ffdfb5;color:#a46e26;border-radius:999px;font-size:11px;padding:5px 10px}.profile{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;color:#8290a3;font-size:11px}.avatar{display:grid;place-items:center;height:32px;width:32px;background:#eaf0fa;border-radius:50%;color:#4d6eaa}.content{padding:40px;max-width:1120px}.overline{font-size:10px;color:#5279b4;letter-spacing:.16em;font-weight:600}.hero{margin:20px 0 28px;position:relative}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(27px,3vw,38px);font-weight:650;line-height:1.4;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:0 0 13px}.hero p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--muted);max-width:550px}.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;margin:28px 0}.stat{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:13px;padding:21px 23px}.stat-label{font-size:11px;color:#8091a9}.stat-number{font-size:27px;font-weight:600;margin:8px 0 4px;letter-spacing:-.03em}.stat-number span{font-size:12px;font-weight:400;margin-left:5px;color:#9aa7b9}.stat-note{font-size:10px;color:#9aa7b9}.section-title{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;margin:30px 0 16px}.scenarios{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:15px}.scenario{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:13px;background:#fff;padding:23px;text-align:left;transition:box-shadow .2s,border-color .2s}.scenario:hover{border-color:#a6c4fc;box-shadow:0 8px 24px #1e438511}.scenario .icon{width:35px;height:35px;border-radius:10px;background:#edf3ff;color:#3970d7;display:grid;place-items:center;margin-bottom:17px;font-size:18px}.scenario h3{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 7px}.scenario p{font-size:11px;color:#8d9cb0;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 16px}.try{font-size:11px;color:#316dd8}.scope{margin-top:25px;border:1px solid #dce6f4;background:#eff5ff;border-radius:11px;padding:15px 18px;color:#617a9c;font-size:11px;line-height:1.9}.scope strong{font-weight:600;color:#3a608e}.bottom{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:24px;font-size:10px;color:#9ba8ba;gap:15px}.bottom button{border:0;background:none;color:#6488bd;padding:0;font-size:11px}.guide{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:13px;padding:20px 24px;margin-top:16px;font-size:12px;color:#657d9a;line-height:1.9}.guide[hidden]{display:none}.guide h3{font-size:14px;color:#3d5f8a}.guide code{font-family:monospace;background:#f4f7fc;padding:2px 5px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}@media(min-width:1500px){.content{max-width:1080px;padding-top:48px}}@media(max-width:1050px){.sidebar{width:176px;padding:25px 12px}.brand{font-size:21px}main{margin-left:176px}.topbar{padding:0 25px}.content{padding:28px 25px}.stats{gap:10px}.stat{padding:18px}.profile .company{display:none}}@media(max-width:700px){.sidebar{display:none}main{margin:0}.topbar{height:65px;padding:0 20px}.content{padding:25px 20px 105px}.stats{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.stat:last-child{display:none}.scenarios{gap:10px}.scenario{padding:17px}.hero h1{font-size:29px}.badge{font-size:10px}.breadcrumb{display:none}.bottom{flex-wrap:wrap}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{transition:none!important}}
</style></head><body>
<aside class="sidebar"><div class="brand"><span class="brand-icon">✦</span> SmartTITU</div><div class="brand-sub">ENTERPRISE AI</div><div class="nav-label">企业服务控制台</div><div class="nav current"><i>▦</i> 智能服务概览</div><div class="nav"><i>◇</i> 模型服务 · 示意</div><div class="nav"><i>▤</i> 用量账单 · 示意</div><div class="nav"><i>⊞</i> API 密钥 · 示意</div><div class="sidebar-foot"><span class="dot"></span>一期 MVP · 交互原型<br><br>导航仅为页面场景示意<br>右下角客服可直接操作</div></aside>
<main><header class="topbar"><div class="breadcrumb">企业控制台　/　<strong>智能服务</strong></div><span class="badge">离线交互原型 · 未连接大模型</span><div class="profile"><span class="company">演示企业</span><span class="avatar">企</span></div></header>
<div class="content"><div class="overline">SMARTTITU INTELLIGENT SUPPORT</div><section class="hero"><h1>让每一次提问，<br>都有据可循。</h1><p>产品咨询、接入指引、故障排查，从一个入口开始。<br>点击右下角智能客服，或选择下方场景，体验完整问答流程。</p></section>
<div class="stats"><section class="stat"><div class="stat-label">客户知识条目</div><div class="stat-number">134<span>条</span></div><div class="stat-note">来自已整理的本地客户知识库</div></section><section class="stat"><div class="stat-label">知识来源</div><div class="stat-number">可追溯</div><div class="stat-note">回答附文件、版本与物理页码</div></section><section class="stat"><div class="stat-label">历史与上下文</div><div class="stat-number">可体验</div><div class="stat-note">本页内存保存 · 刷新即重置</div></section></div>
<h2 class="section-title">从一个真实场景开始</h2><div class="scenarios">
<button class="scenario" data-ask="如何开通账号?"><div class="icon">↗</div><h3>账号开通与接入</h3><p>了解企业账号如何开通、完成认证与首次调用。</p><span class="try">体验开通指引　→</span></button>
<button class="scenario" data-ask="如何创建 API 密钥?"><div class="icon">⌘</div><h3>API 密钥管理</h3><p>了解密钥创建入口、调用权限与保存注意事项。</p><span class="try">体验接入问答　→</span></button>
<button class="scenario" data-ask="调用出现429错误怎么办?"><div class="icon">⌁</div><h3>常见问题排查</h3><p>从错误码出发查找处理方式，展开知识来源。</p><span class="try">体验故障排查　→</span></button>
<button class="scenario" data-ask="转人工客服"><div class="icon">☏</div><h3>人工服务衔接</h3><p>超出知识范围时，展示人工联系电话与邮箱。</p><span class="try">体验人工指引　→</span></button></div>
<div class="scope"><strong>你正在查看独立 HTML 原型。</strong>界面与正式悬浮组件复用同一份代码；回答通过内置知识进行本地关键词检索，不发送网络请求，不调用大模型，不查询企业实时数据。历史会话仅在当前页面内存中保存。</div>
<div class="bottom"><span>SMARTTITU / CUSTOMER ASSISTANT / MVP 1.0</span><button id="guide-toggle">部署与真实联调说明 ↗</button></div>
<section id="guide" class="guide" hidden><h3>如何体验真实后端？</h3><p>解压代码包，在项目根目录运行 <code>python3 manage.py init</code>，再执行 <code>python3 manage.py serve</code>。浏览器访问 <code>http://127.0.0.1:8000/widget/demo</code>，使用 <code>python3 manage.py token --tenant demo --user tester</code> 生成的短期凭证连接。</p><p>真实服务会把历史写入 SQLite；配置 <code>ANSWER_MODE=llm</code> 及模型地址、密钥、模型 ID 后才会调用大模型。详细部署步骤以代码包 README 为准。</p></section>
</div></main>
